sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant API as AuthController
  participant S as AuthService
  participant G as Google
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  C->>API: Google ID token / OAuth callback
  API->>G: Verify Google identity
  G-->>API: Verified email and profile
  API->>S: googleLogin(profile)
  S->>DB: Find user by email
  alt User does not exist
    S->>DB: Create ACTIVE user and OAuth account
    S-->>API: Sign JWT access token
  else User exists and is ACTIVE
    S->>DB: Link OAuth account if needed
    S-->>API: Sign JWT access token
  else User is SUSPENDED or BANNED
    S-->>API: Reject with HTTP 401
  end
  API-->>C: Access token or authentication error
